    {
      "$comment": "CONTESTED — needs a second author's sign-off before it can be quizzed. The Swiss constitution names no capital; Bern is the Bundesstadt (federal city) and the de facto seat of government since 1848. Every atlas answers 'Bern', which is why this is tempting to just ship. Resolve it deliberately, per docs/systems/content-pipeline.md#sensitive-content.",
